1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:51,050
With your cultivation,

25
00:01:51,330 --> 00:01:54,970
how did you get the position of Cloud Sky Sect Leader ?

26
00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:03,610
Because

27
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:06,530
she is my woman.

28
00:02:21,250 --> 00:02:22,410
You're finally back.

29
00:02:22,970 --> 00:02:23,930
It's the Sect Ancestor !

30
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:26,090
The Sect Ancestor is back !

31
00:02:27,330 --> 00:02:28,210
That's awesome !

32
00:02:32,130 --> 00:02:32,950
Ceng Niu !?

33
00:02:33,290 --> 00:02:33,810
What ?

34
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,410
The Sect Ancestor is Ceng Niu ?!

35
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:37,410
The Ceng Niu who chopped off Red Butterfly's arm,

36
00:02:37,650 --> 00:02:38,640
it's him !

37
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:40,440
So you're the one who wants to wipe out the Cloud Sky Sect…

38
00:02:39,770 --> 00:02:41,330
As expected of the Ancestor !

39
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:42,910
Ceng... Ceng Niu,

40
00:02:43,130 --> 00:02:43,490
I...

41
00:02:43,610 --> 00:02:45,490
I didn't know you were from the Cloud Sky Sect.

42
00:02:45,850 --> 00:02:46,690
This time...

43
00:02:46,810 --> 00:02:48,170
This time I was reckless !

44
00:02:48,810 --> 00:02:49,650
Reckless ?

45
00:02:50,970 --> 00:02:53,530
Then you will pay the price of your recklessness !

46
00:03:37,290 --> 00:03:38,250
Ceng Niu,

47
00:03:38,490 --> 00:03:40,410
don’t push this bullying too far !

48
00:03:40,890 --> 00:03:43,610
Bully ? Sure, today I'm the one bullying.

49
00:03:51,930 --> 00:03:52,850
Fleeing already ?

50
00:04:02,730 --> 00:04:03,530
Ceng Niu,

51
00:04:03,730 --> 00:04:06,290
I've only killed a few low level disciples !

52
00:04:06,490 --> 00:04:07,970
There is no death grudge between us !

53
00:04:09,210 --> 00:04:11,970
Now there is.

54
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:43,330
Dao of Insects ?

55
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:45,810
That's right,

56
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:47,570
insects and beasts

57
00:04:47,770 --> 00:04:49,650
are part of the laws of heaven and earth.

58
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:51,690
Heaven and earth are cruel.

59
00:04:52,050 --> 00:04:53,290
If humans can eat beasts,

60
00:04:53,570 --> 00:04:56,290
then beasts can also eat humans !

61
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:03,630
Seal !

62
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:42,370
That fiend is dead...

63
00:05:57,890 --> 00:05:58,480
Wan'er !

64
00:06:01,330 --> 00:06:02,270
Liu Fei, Song Qing,

65
00:06:02,290 --> 00:06:03,290
seal the sect.

66
00:06:03,690 --> 00:06:04,930
No one is allowed to leave.

67
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:05,810
Yes !

68
00:06:22,570 --> 00:06:23,290
This is...

69
00:06:24,290 --> 00:06:25,250
a death aura.

70
00:06:41,970 --> 00:06:42,930
Senior...

71
00:06:46,290 --> 00:06:47,450
Are you feeling better ?

72
00:06:50,010 --> 00:06:51,750
Are you still going to leave ?

73
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:53,290
I'm not leaving.

74
00:06:54,250 --> 00:06:55,050
Really ?

75
00:06:56,090 --> 00:06:56,690
Really.

76
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:01,170
Wan'er,

77
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:02,690
you need to recover.

78
00:07:03,250 --> 00:07:04,250
Get some rest.

79
00:07:18,250 --> 00:07:19,330
What the hell is going on ?

80
00:07:19,970 --> 00:07:21,330
When I left 100 years ago,

81
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:23,170
Wan'er was still fine.

82
00:07:23,890 --> 00:07:25,050
Ancestor,

83
00:07:25,730 --> 00:07:28,850
Elder Li failed to reach Nascent Soul 3 times.

84
00:07:29,370 --> 00:07:31,290
When she last failed 30 years ago,

85
00:07:31,530 --> 00:07:33,090
she almost died...

86
00:07:33,970 --> 00:07:35,050
Since then

87
00:07:35,650 --> 00:07:38,610
her health has been deteriorating day by day.

88
00:07:40,930 --> 00:07:44,410
When I was treating Sect Leader's body,

89
00:07:44,890 --> 00:07:49,210
I discovered that she overused her life energy in the past.

90
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:51,710
Hence the reduction of lifespan.

91
00:07:51,770 --> 00:07:54,310
Now that the Sect Leader is at the end of her life,

92
00:07:54,370 --> 00:07:57,970
she's been relying on pills to survive.

93
00:07:58,490 --> 00:08:00,650
If she was an ordinary Core Formation cultivator,

94
00:08:00,970 --> 00:08:02,290
she'd be long dead.

95
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:05,010
Overuse of life energy ?

96
00:08:06,090 --> 00:08:08,170
The power of that jade slip was amazing...

97
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:11,630
So Wan'er used up her lifespan to make it...

98
00:08:11,810 --> 00:08:13,790
Wan'er is different from Wang Zhuo.

99
00:08:13,970 --> 00:08:15,590
He had reached Nascent Soul

100
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:18,230
so I could help him to be reborn.

101
00:08:18,650 --> 00:08:20,490
But Wan'er is at the end of her lifespan.

102
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:22,330
If I force her reincarnation,

103
00:08:23,570 --> 00:08:25,630
she won't be strong enough to avoid the law of heavens.

104
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:27,690
Now,

105
00:08:28,210 --> 00:08:29,770
the only way to save her life

106
00:08:30,570 --> 00:08:31,970
is to have her reach Nascent Soul.

107
00:08:33,410 --> 00:08:34,030
Liu Fei,

108
00:08:34,050 --> 00:08:34,750
Song Qing,

109
00:08:34,970 --> 00:08:35,570
Yes !

110
00:08:36,170 --> 00:08:37,470
I want to leave with Wan'er.

111
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:39,150
As of today,

112
00:08:39,250 --> 00:08:41,010
you will manage the Cloud Sky Sect.

113
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:43,130
Understood !

114
00:08:43,570 --> 00:08:44,250
Also,

115
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:45,810
the fact that I am Ceng Niu

116
00:08:46,130 --> 00:08:47,570
must not leak.

117
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:49,670
Find a way to deal with the disciples.

118
00:08:49,770 --> 00:08:50,970
Don't worry, Ancestor.

119
00:08:51,290 --> 00:08:53,010
I'll erase their memories.

120
00:08:56,450 --> 00:08:58,570
Lu Fei is willing to follow Ancestor

121
00:08:58,810 --> 00:09:00,250
to ensure your safety.

122
00:09:00,770 --> 00:09:02,210
Tie Yan is also willing.

123
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:08,430
Snowy canyon\NCountry of Chu's border

124
00:09:19,450 --> 00:09:21,010
Senior Zhou Yi's told me that

125
00:09:21,890 --> 00:09:24,770
the celestial jade pagoda must be placed in a Yin Energy gathering spot.

126
00:09:25,530 --> 00:09:26,690
The Celestial's aura

127
00:09:27,410 --> 00:09:30,970
should help Wan'er to temporarily suppress her death aura.

128
00:09:32,490 --> 00:09:34,530
Although there is only a hint of domain in the pagoda,

129
00:09:35,890 --> 00:09:37,730
it must not be underestimated.

130
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,450
Thank you Ancestor.

131
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:44,070
I owe her too much

132
00:09:45,690 --> 00:09:47,690
for all these years I've been gone.

133
00:09:49,690 --> 00:09:50,570
Senior...

134
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:52,450
You're awake.

135
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:58,650
What is this ?

136
00:09:59,530 --> 00:10:00,930
A Senior's artifact.

137
00:10:02,090 --> 00:10:03,630
When I went to the Celestial Realm,

138
00:10:03,690 --> 00:10:05,370
I got to meet that Senior.

139
00:10:06,090 --> 00:10:07,490
He gave it to me before his death

140
00:10:08,010 --> 00:10:10,050
so that I could take care of it for 1000 years.

141
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:14,370
The Celestial Realm is such a dangerous place...

142
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:15,850
are you alright ?

143
00:10:17,170 --> 00:10:18,090
I'm fine.

144
00:10:19,250 --> 00:10:20,210
If you want,

145
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:22,450
I'll tell you the whole story.

146
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:27,690
So...

147
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:32,050
Zhou Yi's wife is inside that pagoda...

148
00:10:33,010 --> 00:10:35,290
While he's trying to avenge her death...

149
00:10:35,850 --> 00:10:38,710
I wonder how Senior Zhou Yi is after he turned into a Sword Spirit

150
00:10:38,770 --> 00:10:40,370
and went to the Da Lou Sword Sect.

151
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:42,410
Whatever the outcome,

152
00:10:44,090 --> 00:10:45,290
it was all his choice.

153
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:49,770
I hope his wish comes true.

154
00:10:54,690 --> 00:10:55,490
This is...?

155
00:10:56,250 --> 00:10:57,570
A gift for you.

156
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:07,330
Grade 5 pill recipes !

157
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,050
They are so expensive,

158
00:11:11,610 --> 00:11:13,330
where did you get them ?

159
00:11:13,930 --> 00:11:14,850
If you want,

160
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:16,210
after this,

161
00:11:16,730 --> 00:11:18,290
I'll get you even more.

162
00:11:20,090 --> 00:11:21,250
Thank you Senior.

163
00:11:28,810 --> 00:11:29,610
Senior,

164
00:11:30,890 --> 00:11:33,010
Wan'er has a favor to ask.

165
00:11:33,890 --> 00:11:34,690
What is it ?

166
00:11:35,970 --> 00:11:36,890
This is

167
00:11:37,610 --> 00:11:39,810
The Soul Bloods of the Cloud Sky Sect.

168
00:11:40,690 --> 00:11:42,130
Can you please

169
00:11:42,730 --> 00:11:44,490
help me return it to them.

170
00:11:45,130 --> 00:11:49,010
I'm afraid that if something happens to me,

171
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:51,650
I'll get them into trouble again.

172
00:11:52,210 --> 00:11:53,870
You won't die.

173
00:11:55,290 --> 00:11:55,910
Wan'er,

174
00:11:56,650 --> 00:11:57,470
trust me,

175
00:11:58,770 --> 00:12:00,210
I will never

176
00:12:01,690 --> 00:12:02,730
let you die.

177
00:12:04,690 --> 00:12:07,150
We will stay here so you can heal in peace,

178
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:08,710
I'll make sure you get better.

179
00:12:13,550 --> 00:12:17,310
1 month later

180
00:12:32,010 --> 00:12:33,370
From today onwards,

181
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:34,810
this place

182
00:12:35,410 --> 00:12:36,810
will be our new home.

183
00:12:40,130 --> 00:12:41,010
Ancestor,

184
00:12:41,450 --> 00:12:42,690
we went to the Sea of Devils

185
00:12:43,130 --> 00:12:44,170
to confirm that

186
00:12:44,490 --> 00:12:46,490
the rank 6 pill that will be auctioned

187
00:12:46,690 --> 00:12:48,390
is a Return to Origin pill.

188
00:12:48,450 --> 00:12:50,150
The auction is in 7 days,

189
00:12:50,210 --> 00:12:51,290
here is the invitation.

190
00:12:52,450 --> 00:12:53,090
Okay.

191
00:12:53,490 --> 00:12:54,770
We take our leave then.

192
00:12:56,490 --> 00:12:56,970
Wait,

193
00:12:58,090 --> 00:12:59,290
every Soul Formation cultivator

194
00:12:59,850 --> 00:13:01,970
must understand the heavens in their own way.

195
00:13:02,890 --> 00:13:04,130
The heavens are ruthless,

196
00:13:04,610 --> 00:13:06,510
but you need a hint of emotion,

197
00:13:06,850 --> 00:13:08,210
at least enough to move your heart.

198
00:13:08,970 --> 00:13:11,090
The spiritual energy in your bodies is a mess.

199
00:13:11,650 --> 00:13:14,490
The area around this pagoda is the best place for you to train.

200
00:13:14,530 --> 00:13:15,870
Go 50 li away from it.

201
00:13:15,930 --> 00:13:18,520
When you can get close to it with your own cultivation,

202
00:13:18,570 --> 00:13:20,520
I will give you two a few more pointers.

203
00:13:22,130 --> 00:13:23,810
Thank you Ancestor.

204
00:13:25,690 --> 00:13:28,050
Although the celestial jade pagoda can suppress her death aura,

205
00:13:28,570 --> 00:13:30,410
it's only a temporary solution.

206
00:13:31,170 --> 00:13:33,010
If I could obtain this grade 6 pill,

207
00:13:33,650 --> 00:13:35,490
I'm sure it'll suppress it for good

208
00:13:36,050 --> 00:13:37,610
and restore Wan'er's life energy.

209
00:13:38,370 --> 00:13:41,730
A grade 6 Return to Origin pill is unheard of,

210
00:13:42,450 --> 00:13:45,610
I didn't expect its formula to show up in the Sea of Devils.

211
00:13:46,210 --> 00:13:47,370
I'll get it,

212
00:13:47,650 --> 00:13:49,400
so you can reach Nascent Soul.

213
00:13:50,650 --> 00:13:51,730
Senior is leaving ?

214
00:13:52,170 --> 00:13:53,290
I'll be right back,

215
00:13:53,770 --> 00:13:54,570
it won't be long.

216
00:13:56,530 --> 00:13:57,970
I want to go with you !

217
00:13:58,610 --> 00:14:00,490
I'm much better now.

218
00:14:00,730 --> 00:14:01,730
It's nothing serious.

219
00:14:02,730 --> 00:14:03,530
Wan'er,

220
00:14:03,970 --> 00:14:06,590
I cut off Red Butterfly's arm in the Rain Celestial Realm.

221
00:14:07,050 --> 00:14:08,450
Now that I'm back on Suzaku,

222
00:14:08,850 --> 00:14:10,170
she will want her revenge.

223
00:14:10,890 --> 00:14:12,970
There will be a lot of people there.

224
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:14,450
This pagoda

225
00:14:14,850 --> 00:14:16,810
is able to withstand attacks from Ascendant cultivators.

226
00:14:17,530 --> 00:14:18,730
It's safer here.

227
00:14:19,850 --> 00:14:20,690
Senior...

228
00:14:22,090 --> 00:14:24,290
I don't want to leave your side ever again.

229
00:14:25,770 --> 00:14:26,570
Wan'er...

230
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:31,490
Also,

231
00:14:31,970 --> 00:14:35,410
there's another place in the Sea of Devils I have been thinking about.

232
00:14:42,890 --> 00:14:45,170
Why is the Ancestor so happy today ?

233
00:14:45,850 --> 00:14:47,290
Rumor has it that the Sea of Devils

234
00:14:47,290 --> 00:14:49,810
is where Ancestor and Elder Li met.

235
00:14:50,370 --> 00:14:51,530
It's a nostalgia trip,

236
00:14:51,770 --> 00:14:53,130
of course they'd be happy.

237
00:14:56,930 --> 00:14:58,170
The Fighting Evil Sect !

238
00:15:04,290 --> 00:15:05,890
How did this happen ?

239
00:15:11,130 --> 00:15:14,210
The cave was here.

240
00:15:16,450 --> 00:15:17,850
It's gone...

241
00:15:19,010 --> 00:15:20,450
The memories of our past

242
00:15:21,290 --> 00:15:22,770
are all gone...

243
00:15:26,850 --> 00:15:27,650
Senior...

244
00:15:29,610 --> 00:15:30,840
Let's go.

245
00:15:32,850 --> 00:15:33,930
The cave is not gone.

246
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:47,330
The Ancestor

247
00:15:47,810 --> 00:15:50,010
pulled a mountain out of the ground !

248
00:15:53,050 --> 00:15:53,850
Wan'er,

249
00:15:54,450 --> 00:15:56,570
the cave is not gone.

250
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:01,890
An exact copy...

251
00:16:04,370 --> 00:16:06,690
You brought me here back then,

252
00:16:07,090 --> 00:16:08,530
saying you want to settle down

253
00:16:09,090 --> 00:16:10,690
and built this cave.

254
00:16:13,170 --> 00:16:15,350
I plan to stay in this cave long-term.

255
00:16:15,450 --> 00:16:17,230
If the formation is broken,

256
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:18,790
I can easily escape.

257
00:16:18,810 --> 00:16:19,910
But you

258
00:16:19,970 --> 00:16:21,630
will have to rely on yourself.

259
00:16:25,730 --> 00:16:26,730
Back then,

260
00:16:27,570 --> 00:16:29,210
I made many pills here

261
00:16:29,970 --> 00:16:31,470
while waiting for your return.

262
00:16:32,330 --> 00:16:35,570
I remember the day you brought back a Flood Dragon.

263
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,930
I always wanted to ask

264
00:16:38,170 --> 00:16:39,730
how you caught it.

265
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:42,970
But you were so cold...

266
00:16:43,770 --> 00:16:45,090
I was afraid to ask.

267
00:16:48,090 --> 00:16:48,890
And then,

268
00:16:49,450 --> 00:16:51,170
I waited here for 3 years.

269
00:16:52,410 --> 00:16:53,930
I didn't expect you to come back

270
00:16:54,330 --> 00:16:56,090
with a bunch of people chasing you.

271
00:16:57,690 --> 00:16:59,130
At that time, your formation

272
00:16:59,610 --> 00:17:00,970
was able to stall enough time.

273
00:17:02,890 --> 00:17:03,930
I helped you,

274
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:06,050
and then you saved me.

275
00:17:07,090 --> 00:17:07,890
Senior,

276
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:10,290
why don't we stay here for a few days ?

277
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:12,250
Sure.

278
00:17:21,890 --> 00:17:22,570
Senior,

279
00:17:22,730 --> 00:17:23,690
what's this ?

280
00:17:25,050 --> 00:17:26,570
This is the Thunder Frog I tamed.

281
00:17:27,450 --> 00:17:28,610
It was seriously injured

282
00:17:29,050 --> 00:17:30,050
in the Celestial Realm.

283
00:17:30,690 --> 00:17:32,520
I haven't found a way to cure it yet.

284
00:17:32,850 --> 00:17:34,250
These pills I made

285
00:17:34,610 --> 00:17:35,970
are useless to me now.

286
00:17:36,250 --> 00:17:37,710
I might as well give them to it.

287
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:45,890
It really worked !

288
00:19:32,770 --> 00:19:33,330
Wan'er,

289
00:19:33,890 --> 00:19:34,890
it's time to go.

290
00:20:01,690 --> 00:20:02,290
Come quick !

291
00:20:02,650 --> 00:20:04,370
A late stage Nascent Soul cultivator ?

292
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:06,010
Senior, it's an honor

293
00:20:06,170 --> 00:20:07,570
to have you here.

294
00:20:09,010 --> 00:20:09,890
This place is messy,

295
00:20:10,050 --> 00:20:11,730
please follow me to the third floor.

296
00:20:11,770 --> 00:20:13,090
There's no way out.

297
00:20:13,530 --> 00:20:14,330
This time,

298
00:20:14,610 --> 00:20:16,130
I've made lots of preparations.

299
00:20:17,290 --> 00:20:18,650
Do you remember the guy

300
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:20,330
who bought the recipes a few days ago ?

301
00:20:20,610 --> 00:20:22,330
Do you think he will come ?

302
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:27,240
Zi Xin\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul

303
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:27,240
Gongsun Fan\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

304
00:20:26,250 --> 00:20:27,330
A Soul Formation cultivator !

305
00:20:48,010 --> 00:20:48,490
This..

306
00:20:49,210 --> 00:20:50,650
Who is this person ?

307
00:20:51,290 --> 00:20:52,050
Hold your tongue,

308
00:20:52,570 --> 00:20:54,450
the two guards are both peak Nascent Soul.

309
00:20:54,710 --> 00:20:56,150
you don't want to anger them.

310
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:02,070
This pill recipe

311
00:21:02,950 --> 00:21:04,390
is mine.

312
00:21:21,150 --> 00:21:27,830
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.

313
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:33,990
Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.

314
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:37,930
Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls

315
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:41,860
and like many other unseparable things.

316
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:47,870
In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

317
00:21:49,050 --> 00:21:54,880
Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

318
00:21:55,190 --> 00:22:00,730
Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.

319
00:22:01,190 --> 00:22:05,410
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul

320
00:22:05,670 --> 00:22:08,900
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

321
00:22:09,070 --> 00:22:14,890
Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.

322
00:22:15,410 --> 00:22:19,090
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

323
00:22:19,190 --> 00:22:23,010
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

324
00:22:23,190 --> 00:22:28,860
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

325
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:32,790
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

326
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:36,570
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

327
00:22:36,690 --> 00:22:42,610
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

328
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:46,690
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

329
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:50,510
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

330
00:22:51,100 --> 00:22:56,340
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

331
00:22:56,410 --> 00:23:00,290
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

332
00:23:00,330 --> 00:23:04,130
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

333
00:23:04,430 --> 00:23:09,990
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

334
00:23:10,630 --> 00:23:16,850
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.

335
00:23:17,150 --> 00:23:23,650
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.

336
00:23:24,670 --> 00:23:30,370
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

337
00:23:30,540 --> 00:23:37,240
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
